.IX Title "Test::Unit::TkTestRunner 3pm"
.TH Test::Unit::TkTestRunner 3pm 2026-04-29 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Test::Unit::TkTestRunner \- unit testing framework helper class
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 2
\&    use Test::Unit::TkTestRunner;
\&    Test::Unit::TkTestRunner::main($my_testcase_class);
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
This class is the test runner for the GUI style use of the testing
framework.
.PP
It is used by simple command line tools like the \fITkTestRunner.pl\fR
script provided.
.PP
The class needs as arguments the names of the classes encapsulating
the tests to be run.
